# Firebending Student: X is its power as the firebending ability resolves (CR 608.2h), not as it triggers. It attacks as a 1/2;
# with the ability on the stack Bot1 casts Giant Growth on it, which also triggers prowess. Prowess (+1/+1) and Giant Growth (+3/+3)
# resolve first, so the firebending ability resolves with the Student a 5/6 and adds {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}, not the {R} its power was
# when it attacked.

